  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\n## [0.16.1] - 2026-04-17\n\n### 🚀 Features\n\n- *(Control)* Add NumericUpDown control\n- *(Control)* 添加了双侧按钮的 NumericUpDown 主题\n- Add expanded event to drawer\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n- *(Markdown)* 修复 UIInlineContainer 内部元素无法被识别为 Markdown 类\n- *(Control)* Align Drawer expanded state naming\n\n### 💼 Other\n\n- *(format)* Format\n\n### ⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks\n\n- *(dpes)* Update packages\n\n<!-- generated by git-cliff -->",
